{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36280","headline":"送睦州侯郎中赴阙 · 方干","name":"送睦州侯郎中赴阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔着政声闻国外，今留儒术化江东。\n青云旧路归仙掖，白凤新词入圣聪。\n弦管未知银烛晓，旌旗已侍锦帆风。\n郡人难议酬恩德，徧在三年礼遇中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36280.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36280","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}